# 【真實故障】停 broker3 → URP 告警 → 收到 FIRING;恢復後收到 RESOLVED
$ docker stop broker3;等 FIRING 信;docker start broker3;等 RESOLVED 信
▶ 真的停 broker3:JMX 告警 KafkaJmxUnderReplicatedPartitions(warning)觸發 → 寄出 FIRING;恢復後告警解除 → 寄出 RESOLVED
停 broker3
   20 秒後:收到 FIRING 信(最多 4 分鐘)
恢復 broker3
   27 秒後:收到 RESOLVED 信(最多 6 分鐘)
收件匣:
  [Kafka][RESOLVED] KafkaJmxUnderReplicatedPartitions(warning) | kafka-ops@corp.demo | 1 alert for alertname=KafkaJmxUnderReplicatedPartitions severity=warning View in
  [Kafka][RESOLVED] RouteWarn(warning) | kafka-ops@corp.demo | 1 alert for alertname=RouteWarn severity=warning View in Alertmanager [1] Resolv
  [Kafka][CRITICAL][RESOLVED] RouteCrit | kafka-oncall@corp.demo | 1 alert for alertname=RouteCrit severity=critical View in Alertmanager [1] Resol
  [Kafka][RESOLVED] MailTest(warning) | kafka-ops@corp.demo | 1 alert for alertname=MailTest severity=warning View in Alertmanager [1] Resolve
  [Kafka][FIRING] KafkaJmxUnderReplicatedPartitions(warning) | kafka-ops@corp.demo | 1 alert for alertname=KafkaJmxUnderReplicatedPartitions severity=warning View in
判定:真實故障走完整條路徑:停 1 台 broker → Prometheus 規則 → Alertmanager → 郵件(FIRING),恢復後收到 RESOLVED
